{
  "$comment": "Custom Tailwind classes a Container's class inspector accepts. The ONE source for tailwind.config.js's safelist (base + hover: + focus:) and the panel's validation (lib/builder/customClasses.ts), so every accepted class is guaranteed to exist in the built CSS. Add classes here, never to the safelist directly. Colours are limited to what this project's theme defines (red/amber/green/purple/pink are single values here, so no shades); batch5.test.tsx builds every class to prove it exists.",
